"""G1 batch B: ten everyday cases spread over ten specialties, derived from open-access guideline/review articles (CC BY). Writes cases_g1/g1_011..g1_020 with the same schema and the same rules as batch A.

  python3 scripts/build_g1b_cases.py --sources-dir <dir with g1NN.txt (article text) and g1NN_PMCID.xml> --out cases_g1

Same provenance rules as scripts/build_g1_cases.py: the patient story, history facts and results are AUTHORED as a typical presentation; the reference diagnosis and management items come from the article, and every item carries a quote that is checked
against the article text (alphanumeric-only comparison). Items the article does not state are not scored. Nothing is clinically reviewed. No API call is made here.
"""
